     "text": [
      "=== A. What a language costs ===\n",
      "\n",
      "cl100k_base:\n",
      "lang   tokens   chars   tok/char   ×English   $/1000 sentences\n",
      "kk       200     263     0.760      3.75              1.00\n",
      "ru       129     277     0.466      2.30              0.65\n",
      "en        59     291     0.203      1.00              0.29\n",
      "\n",
      "o200k_base:\n",
      "lang   tokens   chars   tok/char   ×English   $/1000 sentences\n",
      "kk        84     263     0.319      1.58              0.42\n",
      "ru        74     277     0.267      1.32              0.37\n",
      "en        59     291     0.203      1.00              0.29\n",
      "\n",
      "=== B. What a homoglyph does ===\n",
      "\n",
      "Sentence KZ-03: Δ=4 tokens (16 -> 20), diverge at 0\n",
      "  char 0 is 'A' - LATIN CAPITAL LETTER A\n",
      "  char 2 is 'a' - LATIN SMALL LETTER A\n",
      "  char 5 is 't' - LATIN SMALL LETTER T\n",
      "  correct   : ['А', 'лая', 'қ', 'тарға', ' ақша']\n",
      "  corrupted : ['A', 'л', 'a', 'я', 'қ']\n",
      "\n",
      "Sentence KZ-08: Δ=3 tokens (21 -> 24), diverge at 1\n",
      "  char 1 is 'o' - LATIN SMALL LETTER O\n",
      "  char 3 is 'a' - LATIN SMALL LETTER A\n",
      "  char 9 is 'T' - LATIN CAPITAL LETTER T\n",
      "  correct   : ['Д', 'он', 'аль', 'д', ' Т', 'рамп']\n",
      "  corrupted : ['Д', 'o', 'н', 'a', 'л', 'ль']\n",
      "\n",
      "=== C. Did it get better? ===\n",
      "kk  : 0.760 -> 0.319 (change +0.441)\n",
      "ru  : 0.466 -> 0.267 (change +0.199)\n",
      "en  : 0.203 -> 0.203 (change +0.000)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "%run -i sublab_hard/tokenizer_forensics.py"
   ]
  },
